  "ai_usage": "Icon-only controls. This clip-path recipe keeps text in the accessibility tree while removing it visually — display:none and visibility:hidden remove it from both.",
  "path": "effects/accessibility-patterns/visually-hidden-text.html",
  "source": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n  <title>Visually Hidden Text</title>\n  <script type=\"application/json\" id=\"effect-meta\">\n  {\n    \"id\": \"visually-hidden-text\",\n    \"title\": \"Visually Hidden Text\",\n    \"summary\": \"Content available to screen readers only.\",\n    \"description\": \"Content available to screen readers only.\",\n    \"theme\": \"accessibility-patterns\",\n    \"categories\": [\"accessibility\", \"reference\"],\n    \"tags\": [\"accessibility\", \"a11y\", \"visually-hidden\", \"screen-reader\", \"sr-only\", \"labels\"],\n    \"tech\": [\"css\"],\n    \"era\": \"2020s\",\n    \"difficulty\": \"intermediate\",\n    \"dependencies\": [],\n    \"browser_support\": \"All modern browsers (Chromium, Firefox, Safari).\",\n    \"performance_notes\": \"Lightweight — composited transform/opacity work only.\",\n    \"accessibility_notes\": \"These specimens are the accessibility reference — each demonstrates the correct semantics, not just the visual result.\",\n    \"customization\": [\n      { \"name\": \"--size\", \"description\": \"Icon button size\", \"default\": \"46px\" }\n    ],\n    \"variations\": [\"Retune the palette\", \"Scale for a compact variant\"],\n    \"ai_usage\": \"Icon-only controls. This clip-path recipe keeps text in the accessibility tree while removing it visually — display:none and visibility:hidden remove it from both.\"\n  }\n  </script>\n  <style>\n    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    html, body { height: 100%; margin: 0; }\n    body { display: grid; place-items: center; background: #0b0d12; color: #e7ebf3;\n      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif; overflow: hidden; }\n    .fx { display: flex; gap: 10px; }\n    .fx button { width: 46px; height: 46px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #263149; background: #151b2a;\n      color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 1.1rem; cursor: pointer; }\n    .sr-only { position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden;\n      clip: rect(0 0 0 0); clip-path: inset(50%); white-space: nowrap; border: 0; }\n    .note { margin-top: .9rem; color: #8b93a7; font-size: .8rem; max-width: 260px; line-height: 1.5; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div><div class=\"fx\"><button type=\"button\">✂<span class=\"sr-only\">Cut</span></button>\n  <button type=\"button\">⧉<span class=\"sr-only\">Copy</span></button>\n  <button type=\"button\">📋<span class=\"sr-only\">Paste</span></button></div>\n  <p class=\"note\">Each button carries a hidden label, so screen readers announce “Cut”, not “scissors”.</p></div>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
}
